  "details": "I apologize if this is a duplicate. I could not find it with the search.\nDescription:\nTo delete a status text in the menu with the \"X\" button you have to open the text field after you already deleted the text, click submit and then click update for it to change.\nHaving to enter the text field seems unnecessary and it should update by simply hitting \"X\" button and then the \"Update\" button.\nSteps to reproduce:\n1. Set a status text\n2. Delete status text with \"X\" button\n3. Click \"Update\" button at the bottom\nExpectation:\nStatus text should be deleted\nResult:\nStatus text has not changed\nTo change the status text you have to add this step:\n2.a Click into the text field -> click submit",
